                                "sense_id": "7288bbcd-c0a5-3088-95a7-b0da240768e4",
                                "text": "The exact mechanism is not yet fully understood but it seems that oligodendrocytes might provide the axons with metabolites across the soma and cytoplasm near the periaxonal space underneath the myelin sheath."
